ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/b337ae3b8224635478267e933f8c7f22.poster.avif?t=1772759896\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/b337ae3b8224635478267e933f8c7f22.webm?t=1772759896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/b337ae3b8224635478267e933f8c7f22.mp4?t=1772759896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a compelling narrative full of twists and turns, <i>FOLLOW</i> reveals the backstory of a complex universe, immersing players into the story and characters that shape Anne\u2019s destiny and the world around her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/a0b57a8c2e8c5503f87b6baba8d6309a.poster.avif?t=1772759896\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/a0b57a8c2e8c5503f87b6baba8d6309a.webm?t=1772759896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846530/extras/a0b57a8c2e8c5503f87b6baba8d6309a.mp4?t=1772759896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u27a4 Explore unsettling environments while solving puzzles,   <br>\u27a4 Reconstruct Anne's troubled story, <br>\u27a4 Escape from terrifying creatures lurking in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   